# The cloud services test's steps (cloud-test): the store app installs what
# a developer published to the cloud's store, 鸿雁's reply arrives through
# the cloud's push gateway, 设置 › 系统更新 reads the cloud's update server.

== 云端商店：开发者经云端商店发布，手机从云端的目录下载安装
store-publish notes 1.0
type /
type 应用商店
key enter
wait 便签 30000
key down 20
key enter
wait 应用商店（已审核） 10000
wait 安装「便签」
key enter
wait 已安装「便签」 60000
key f4

== 云端推送：鸿雁的回复经云端的推送网关送到手机
type /
type 鸿雁
key enter
wait 张三 30000
type /
type 张三
key enter
key enter
wait 输入消息
type 你好
key enter
wait 收到：你好 60000
key f4

== 云端更新服务器：设置 › 系统更新读云端的 latest.json
type /
type 设置
key enter
wait 应用权限 30000
type /
type 系统更新
key enter
key enter
wait 正在运行 30000
type c
wait 可安装：cloud-1 60000
